description: Livewire usage rules (for reactive components).
alwaysApply: true

- Use Livewire for server-driven interactivity (forms, cart, filters).
- Keep Livewire components small; split when they grow.
- Validate in Livewire components; emit events rather than mixing heavy JS.
- Avoid conflicting DOM manipulation between Livewire and jQuery; coordinate via events.
- Test Livewire actions for key flows.
